Description: Shareable Oxlint configuration rules for 50x–100x faster Rust-powered JS/TS linting
 @sebastienrousseau/oxlint-config is a shareable configuration preset with no runtime
 dependencies: inert data plus a loader.
 .
 Installed under /usr/share/nodejs so that require() resolves it without
 further configuration.
